### 1. POST exitoso - 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/baremos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "versionFormularioId": 1,
  "factor": "S1",
  "puntuacionDirecta": 12,
  "percentil": 45,
  "vigencia": "2026-08-17",
  "estado": "ACTIVO"
}

### 2. GET todos - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/baremos

### 3. GET por ID - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/baremos/1

### 4. PUT exitoso - 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/baremos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "versionFormularioId": 1,
  "factor": "S1",
  "puntuacionDirecta": 14,
  "percentil": 52,
  "vigencia": "2026-08-17",
  "estado": "INACTIVO"
}

